 tags=['what if you chewed ice every day','chewing ice','is chewing ice bad for your teeth','ice craving','pagophagia','iron deficiency','anemia','cracked tooth','tooth enamel','dental health','teeth facts','bad habits','health facts','science explained','howcome','komo','what if','shorts'],
